OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites.
OL,9,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     FJerome Kuhn conducts soloists and
OL,11,     Fthe BBC Concert Orchestra in a
OL,12,     Fmythologically themed programme,
OL,13,     Fincluding a semi-staged
OL,14,     Fperformance of David Buckley's
OL,15,     Fone-act opera Oracle.
OL,16,G2145 The Essay: John Foxx - Key Moments
OL,17,     FJohn Foxx takes us through the
OL,18,     Fhistory of the five pianos which
OL,19,     Fhave shaped his music. As the lead
OL,20,     Fsinger of Ultravox and a solo
OL,21,     Fartist, pianos have been his
OL,22,     Flife-long obsession.
